---
// Ícones em linha (24×24, traço herda a cor do texto).
interface Props { name: string; size?: number; class?: string }
const { name, size = 24, class: cls = "" } = Astro.props;

const paths: Record<string, string> = {
  "arrow-up-right": `<path d="M7 17 17 7M8 7h9v9"/>`,
  "arrow-left": `<path d="M19 12H5M11 6l-6 6 6 6"/>`,
  plus: `<path d="M12 5v14M5 12h14"/>`,
  menu: `<path d="M4 9h16M4 15h16"/>`,
  mail: `<rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="3"/><path d="m4 7 8 6 8-6"/>`,
  whatsapp: `<path d="M4.5 19.5 5.6 16A8.2 8.2 0 1 1 8.4 18.6Z"/><path d="M9.2 8.6c.2-.4.5-.5.8-.5h.4c.2 0 .4.1.5.4l.6 1.4c.1.2 0 .5-.1.7l-.5.6c.6 1.1 1.4 1.9 2.5 2.5l.6-.5c.2-.2.5-.2.7-.1l1.4.6c.3.1.4.3.4.5v.4c0 .3-.1.6-.5.8-.6.4-1.5.5-2.4.1a8.7 8.7 0 0 1-4.4-4.4c-.4-.9-.3-1.8.1-2.4Z"/>`,
  instagram: `<rect x="3.5" y="3.5" width="17" height="17" rx="5"/><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="3.8"/><circle cx="17.2" cy="6.8" r=".6" fill="currentColor"/>`,
  linkedin: `<path d="M7 10v7M7 7v.01M11 17v-7M11 13.5c0-2 1.2-3.5 3-3.5s3 1.2 3 3.5V17"/>`,
  behance: `<path d="M3.5 6.5h4.2a2.6 2.6 0 0 1 0 5.2H3.5Zm0 5.2h4.8a2.9 2.9 0 0 1 0 5.8H3.5ZM14.5 14.2h6c0-2.1-1.3-3.6-3-3.6s-3 1.5-3 3.4 1.3 3.5 3.1 3.5c1.2 0 2.1-.5 2.6-1.4M15 7.5h4.4"/>`,
  brand: `<path d="m12 3 2.4 5.2L20 9l-4 4 1 5.7L12 16l-5 2.7L8 13 4 9l5.6-.8Z"/>`,
  web: `<rect x="3" y="4.5" width="18" height="15" rx="3"/><path d="M3 9h18M6.5 6.8h.01M9 6.8h.01"/>`,
  ui: `<path d="m6 4 12 6.5-5.2 1.5L10.5 17Z"/><path d="m13 12.5 4.5 4.5"/>`,
  social: `<path d="M12 20s-7.5-4.4-7.5-10A4.2 4.2 0 0 1 12 7.6 4.2 4.2 0 0 1 19.5 10c0 5.6-7.5 10-7.5 10Z"/>`,
  package: `<path d="m12 3 8 4.5v9L12 21l-8-4.5v-9Z"/><path d="m4 7.5 8 4.5 8-4.5M12 12v9"/>`,
  print: `<path d="M7 9V3.5h10V9"/><rect x="3.5" y="9" width="17" height="8" rx="2.5"/><path d="M7 14h10v6.5H7Z"/>`,
  figma: `<path d="M9 3.5h3v5.7H9a2.85 2.85 0 0 1 0-5.7ZM12 3.5h3a2.85 2.85 0 0 1 0 5.7h-3ZM9 9.2h3v5.7H9a2.85 2.85 0 0 1 0-5.7ZM9 14.9h3v2.85a2.85 2.85 0 1 1-3-2.85Z"/><circle cx="15" cy="12.05" r="2.85"/>`,
  vscode: `<path d="m16.5 3.5 4 2v13l-4 2L7 12Z"/><path d="M16.5 3.5v17M7 12 3.5 9.2M7 12l-3.5 2.8"/>`,
  notion: `<rect x="4" y="3.5" width="16" height="17" rx="2.5"/><path d="M9 16.5v-9l6 9v-9"/>`,
};

// Ferramentas da Adobe: as letras dentro do quadrado, como nos ícones oficiais.
const letters: Record<string, string> = { photoshop: "Ps", illustrator: "Ai", aftereffects: "Ae" };
---
{letters[name] ? (
  <svg class:list={["icon", "icon--letters", cls]} width={size} height={size} viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true">
    <rect x="2.5" y="2.5" width="19" height="19" rx="5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" />
    <text x="12" y="16" text-anchor="middle" fill="currentColor" font-size="9" font-weight="700" font-family="var(--font-heading)">{letters[name]}</text>
  </svg>
) : (
  <svg class:list={["icon", cls]} width={size} height={size} viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" set:html={paths[name] ?? ""} />
)}
